---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BatteryPassportViewer from '../../components/BatteryPassportViewer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="LMT & E-Bike Battery Passport Solutions (≤25kg) | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Compliance for Light Means of Transport (LMT) batteries powering e-bikes, e-scooters, and electric mopeds under EU Regulation 2023/1542."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">Light Means of Transport (LMT &le; 25kg)</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        LMT & E-Bike Battery Passport <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">Enterprise Solutions</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Dedicated compliance pipelines for sealed traction batteries &le; 25kg powering electric bicycles, light electric mopeds, e-scooters, and electric three-wheelers under Article 77 of Regulation (EU) 2023/1542.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="neo-btn-primary">
          Request LMT Battery Scoping →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Live Interactive Viewer -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <BatteryPassportViewer />
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Industry Challenges Solved (from Wuxi presentation) -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-2">Tailored for Two/Three-Wheeler Supply Chains</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Overcoming the 4 Common LMT Data Hurdles
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-16">
      
      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-3.5">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Dispersed Supplier Data</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Upstream cell, BMS, and pack materials are scattered. We supply standardized data responsibility matrices and portal templates for rapid collection.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-3.5">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Carbon Boundary Ambiguity</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          LMT battery manufacturing carbon boundaries must be auditable. Our engine pre-sets PEFCR methodologies, emission factors, and calculation logs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-3.5">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">BMS Telemetry Scoping</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Dynamic data doesn't mean uploading everything. We define clear collection thresholds, retention cycles, and role-based authorization rules.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-6">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-navy-800 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm mb-3.5">
          04
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Pre-Print QR Allocation</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
          Once casing labels are printed, changing is costly. We pre-allocate permanent GS1 Digital Link URIs during pack casing design before production.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Action Card -->
    <div class="neo-surface p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Prepare Your LMT Battery Portfolio for European Exports</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Speak with our light mobility battery compliance desk for technical scoping and data vault onboarding.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-5">
        <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="neo-btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>Email: info@eudppprovider.com</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
